# Installation hum sensors.
#
# A sensor placed here (same shape as the bundled ones in the parent dir:
# `export const meta = { name, lanes }` and a default `detect(ctx)` returning
# events) is loaded by bin/hum-sense when no kernel sensor has that file name
# (lib/hum-events.mjs PATHS.sensorExtDir). Enable it the way the bundled
# sensors are enabled (examples/hum-sensors.example.json).
#
# Everything here except this file is gitignored — see .gitignore and
# docs/architecture-public-private.md.
